determining a plurality of emergency call characteristics associated with the emergency call, the characteristics comprising at least one of call severity, caller location, available emergency responder resources, or network congestion;
dynamically generating a polling schedule for monitoring the emergency call or emergency response status based on the determined plurality of emergency call characteristics, the polling schedule defining at least one of a polling frequency, a polling interval, or a polling duration;
executing a plurality of polls according to the dynamically generated polling schedule, each poll configured to gather real-time status information related to the emergency call or an associated emergency response;
analyzing the gathered real-time status information; and
triggering an action based on the analyzed real-time status information, the action comprising at least one of adjusting the polling schedule, dispatching additional emergency resources, updating emergency personnel, or alerting a central emergency management system.

