an output interface coupled to the processor, configured to present the compensated humidity value.

A method for speculative decompression of a compressed data stream, comprising:
receiving a compressed data stream;
speculatively determining a future decompression operation for a portion of the compressed data stream, said speculative determination being performed prior to a confirmed need for said future decompression operation;
performing decompression of said portion of the compressed data stream based on the speculatively determined future decompression operation;
validating the speculatively determined future decompression operation; and
responsive to a successful validation, utilizing the decompressed portion of the compressed data stream;
responsive to an unsuccessful validation, performing a non-speculative decompression of the portion of the compressed data stream.

A method for joint beamforming in a point-to-point wireless communication network, the method comprising:
at a transmitter comprising a transmit antenna array, transmitting a pilot signal;
at a receiver comprising a receive antenna array, receiving the pilot signal and estimating channel state information (CSI) for a wireless channel between the transmitter and the receiver;
at the receiver, determining a receive beamforming vector based on the estimated CSI;
at the receiver, generating feedback information based on the estimated CSI, the feedback information indicative of preferred transmit beamforming characteristics;
transmitting, at the receiver, the feedback information to the transmitter;
at the transmitter, receiving the feedback information and determining a transmit beamforming vector based on the received feedback information;
applying, at the transmitter, the determined transmit beamforming vector to a data stream to generate a transmit beamformed signal;
transmitting, at the transmitter, the transmit beamformed signal to the receiver;
receiving, at the receiver, the transmit beamformed signal; and
applying, at the receiver, the determined receive beamforming vector to the received transmit beamformed signal to extract a data stream.

A transparent metallic millimeter-wave window comprising:
